sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(220,233,250) CLIENTE
    participant C as Cliente (web / Tkinter)
    end
    box rgb(253,235,208) INFRAESTRUCTURA
    participant RP as Reverse Proxy (TLS :443)
    participant GW as API Gateway (Kong)
    participant LB as Load Balancer
    end
    box rgb(213,245,227) MICROSERVICIOS
    participant L as Login
    participant B as Books x3
    participant P as Pedidos
    participant PG as Pagos
    end
    box rgb(235,222,240) DATOS
    participant R as Redis
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    end
    Note over C,DB: A) Autenticación JWT
    C->>RP: POST /auth/login {identity, password}
    RP->>GW: reenvía (ruta pública)
    GW->>LB: /auth → upstream login
    LB->>L: instancia sana
    L->>DB: verifica bcrypt + email verificado
    L->>R: guarda session:sid y refresh:hash
    L-->>C: 200 {access_token (HS256, 20 min), refresh_token}
    Note over C,DB: B) Compra (Authorization: Bearer token)
    C->>RP: GET /books (público)
    RP->>GW: reenvía
    GW->>LB: /books
    LB->>B: Least Connections (Books-1/2/3)
    B->>R: books:list (caché 60 s)
    B-->>C: 200 catálogo
    C->>RP: POST /pedidos  Bearer JWT
    RP->>GW: reenvía
    GW->>GW: valida firma, exp, iss, aud + rate limit
    GW->>LB: /pedidos (+ X-User-Id, X-Role)
    LB->>P: instancia sana
    P->>R: ¿jti revocado?
    P->>DB: INSERT customer_order (pending)
    P-->>C: 201 {order_id}
    C->>GW: POST /pedidos/{id}/lineas {isbn, qty}
    GW->>P: (JWT validado)
    P->>DB: SELECT book FOR UPDATE · stock − qty
    P-->>C: 201 línea agregada
    C->>GW: POST /pagos {order_id, amount, method}
    GW->>PG: (JWT validado, dueño del pedido)
    PG->>DB: INSERT payment (pending)
    PG-->>C: 201 pago pending
    Note over GW,PG: Admin: PATCH /pagos/{id} status=approved → pedido pasa a paid
